---

This licence covers the software: everything under `universe/`, `tools/`,
`tests/`, and the scripts at the top level. Take it, fork it, run your own
campaign on it.

It does not cover the campaign itself. Everything under `content/` is the
shared worldbuilding of the people who play The Buried Star, written by them,
and it is here because the wiki keeps its history in git rather than because
it is offered for reuse. Read it, enjoy it, borrow an idea. Don't republish it
as your own.
